## Overview
pyrage is a collection of Python bindings for the Rust implementation of age. The module itself is pure Rust, with the excellent pyO3 providing the Python interface.

## Availability on PyPI
You can install pyrage with pip, and PEP 561-style type stubs are also available. The current version on PyPI is 1.3.0 (as shown in the search results).

