The search results indicate that pyrage has recent releases and continues to be maintained. The project appears to have an active release history with multiple versions available on PyPI (1.0.2, 1.2.1, 1.3.0, and various release candidates). The latest version 1.3.0 was uploaded using Trusted Publishing with twine, suggesting ongoing maintenance.

## Features
The library provides support for:
- Identity-based encryption and decryption
- Passphrase-based encryption and decryption
- x25519 key generation
- SSH key support


